          "For a fuller comparison, see [Agile vs Waterfall](/project-management/agile/agile-vs-waterfall/). This guide assumes you have the freedom to run one project the Agile way. Read [how to implement Agile](/project-management/agile/how-to-implement-agile/) if you are introducing Agile across teams or a department.",
