          "Where does the project manager fit? On a single Scrum team the project management work is shared out: the Product Owner owns scope and priorities, the team owns delivery and the Scrum Master owns the process. Many organisations keep an [Agile project manager](/project-management/agile/agile-project-manager/) to handle budget, contracts, risks, dependencies and reporting, especially on larger or hybrid projects.",
