          "Protect the Sprint Goal. If something urgent arrives, the Product Owner decides whether it waits for the next sprint or, in rare cases, whether the Sprint Goal is still worth pursuing. For more on how sprints work, see [what is a sprint](/project-management/agile/what-is-a-sprint/).",
