          "Treat risks the same way. Add risk-reducing work, such as a prototype or a load test, to the backlog and order it early. Keep a simple log of risks, assumptions, issues and dependencies, for example our [RAID log template](/templates/raid-log-template/), and review the top items at each Sprint Review.",
          "Larger changes that affect the vision, budget or time window go back to the sponsor. That is a governance decision, not a backlog decision.",
