          "Avoid percentage complete: on an Agile project the total scope changes, so the percentage misleads. A burnup chart shows both lines, completed work and total scope, so everyone can see whether the gap is closing. Our guide to the [Agile velocity chart](/project-management/agile/agile-velocity-chart/) explains how to read the team's delivery trend.",
